{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wgc-e-14-e1","title":"晋纪记寿春被围时亢旱而陷城日大雨","order":5610,"accounts":[{"id":"wgc-a-14-e1","label":"裴注·晋纪","text":"晋纪记寿春被围时亢旱而陷城日大雨","evidence":["wgc-q0595","wgc-q0116"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0044","role":"笑文王筑围言不攻自败","evidence":["wgc-q0595","wgc-q0116"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0595","wgc-q0116"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0595"}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0044","name":"诸葛诞","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0116","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7250287caaecda5d07c5","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞干宝《晋纪》曰：“初，寿春每岁雨潦，淮水溢，常淹城邑。故文王之筑围也，诞笑之曰：‘是固不攻而自败也！’及大军之攻，亢旱逾年。城既陷，是日大雨，围垒皆毁。诞子靓，字仲思。吴平还晋。靓子恢，字道明。位至尚书令，追赠左光禄大夫，开府。”","attribution":"干宝晋纪","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b0443e64d8a54e613793","start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0595","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7250287caaecda5d07c5","layer":"pei","quote":"初，寿春每岁雨潦，淮水溢，常淹城邑。故文王之筑围也，诞笑之曰：‘是固不攻而自败也！’及大军之攻，亢旱逾年。城既陷，是日大雨，围垒皆毁","attribution":"裴注·晋纪","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b0443e64d8a54e613793","start":12,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
